<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mostly lower in heavy trading on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 36.15 to 6029.38.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite gained 1.78 to 374.50.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.19.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers by 1,462 to 929.</p>
<p>Volume was 482,795,210 compared to 437,773,440 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT).</p>
